# Unreal Engine generated / per-machine. None of this belongs in version control:
# Intermediate alone is 2.7 GB, and every one of these is rebuilt or regenerated locally.
Binaries/
DerivedDataCache/
Intermediate/
Saved/

# Visual Studio / IDE
.vs/
*.sln
*.suo
*.opensdf
*.sdf
*.VC.db
*.VC.opendb
*.user

# OS cruft
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Blender writes a .blend1 next to every .blend it saves. The .blend itself is source art and IS
# tracked (BlenderFile/), because without it the bug model cannot be re-exported or changed.
*.blend1

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# What IS tracked: the .uproject, Config/, Content/, Source/, Tools/, Docs/.
#
# Content/ is 163 MB of binary .uasset files, which is normal and unavoidable for an Unreal
# project - a .uasset cannot be diffed or merged, so expect "one locker at a time" on it.
# The largest single file is 20 MB, well under GitHub's 100 MB hard limit.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
